      "subject": "DAMIT 4859: selected shape and spin",
      "status": "included",
      "finding": "The official DAMIT metadata export was joined by model and asteroid identity and compared with the selected local recipe shape/model-4859.txt. Model 4859, version 2019-10-23, pole (184°, 54°), period 7.3561 h match the retained metadata. The archive supplies no diameter for this model; a separate scale constraint is required. This comparison checks source identity and metadata, not fresh mesh bytes, registration or the completeness of other archives.",
